{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/chouyo/project_filedock/pull/1","repo":"chouyo/project_filedock","number":1,"set":"agent","source":"copilot-agent","title":"Restructure repository into `app/` + `web/` and realign app paths","body":"This change moves the existing FileDock desktop application under `app/` and reserves `web/` for the future product site, while preserving the current app’s internal path relationships. It also updates the affected scripts, workflow paths, ignore rules, and documentation so the moved app remains runnable from its new location.\n\n- **Repository layout**\n  - Moved the current desktop app from the repository root into `app/`\n  - Added `web/README.md` as the placeholder for the future website\n  - Added root `README.md` and `app/README.md` to clarify repo/app responsibilities\n\n- **Script and config path realignment**\n  - Updated `app/scripts/dev.ps1` to resolve `app/` from the script location before running `npm run tauri dev`\n  - Updated `app/scripts/generate-icons.ps1` to:\n    - resolve its working directory to `app/`\n    - treat relative `-Source` values as relative to `app/`\n    - default to `app/app-icon.png`\n    - fail with a clear message when that default source does not exist\n  - Kept `app/scripts/build-all.ps1` delegating to `scripts/build-*.ps1` from within `app/` to avoid broken `app/app/scripts/...` paths\n  - Preserved `app/src-tauri/tauri.conf*.json` relative behavior (`frontendDist: ../dist`, fixed runtime path relative to `app/src-tauri/`)\n\n- **Workflow and ignore updates**\n  - Updated the existing GitHub Actions workflow to run npm/Tauri commands in `app/` and upload artifacts from `app/src-tauri/...`\n  - Expanded root `.gitignore` to explicitly cover `app` and `web` dependency/build outputs, including Tauri target/gen/runtime paths\n\n- **Documentation updates**\n  - Updated `AGENTS.md` for the new repo structure and command entry points\n  - Updated `docs/用户手册.md` references that pointed at old root-level app paths\n  - Added root-level guidance for `app/`, `web/`, `docs/`, and `.github/`\n\n- **Dependency security follow-up**\n  - Bumped `app`’s `vite` dependency from the vulnerable `5.x` line to `^6.4.3`\n  - Updated `app/package-lock.json` accordingly\n\n```powershell\n# app/scripts/dev.ps1\n$appRoot = Split-Path -Parent $PSScriptRoot\nSet-Location -LiteralPath $appRoot\nnpm run tauri dev\n```","authorType":"Bot","additions":403,"deletions":239,"changedFiles":133,"files":[{"path":".github/workflows/build.yml","additions":7,"deletions":2},{"path":".gitignore","additions":14,"deletions":0},{"path":"AGENTS.md","additions":35,"deletions":26},{"path":"README.md","additions":31,"deletions":0},{"path":"app/README.md","additions":30,"deletions":0},{"path":"app/index.html","additions":0,"deletions":0},{"path":"app/package-lock.json","additions":229,"deletions":186},{"path":"app/package.json","additions":1,"deletions":1},{"path":"app/postcss.config.js","additions":0,"deletions":0},{"path":"app/public/logo.svg","additions":0,"deletions":0},{"path":"app/scripts/build-all.ps1","additions":0,"deletions":0},{"path":"app/scripts/build-download.ps1","additions":0,"deletions":0},{"path":"app/scripts/build-embed.ps1","additions":0,"deletions":0},{"path":"app/scripts/build-fixed.ps1","additions":0,"deletions":0},{"path":"app/scripts/build-offline.ps1","additions":0,"deletions":0},{"path":"app/scripts/build-skip.ps1","additions":0,"deletions":0},{"path":"app/scripts/dev.ps1","additions":5,"deletions":1},{"path":"app/scripts/generate-icons.ps1","additions":44,"deletions":0},{"path":"app/src-tauri/Cargo.lock","additions":0,"deletions":0},{"path":"app/src-tauri/Cargo.toml","additions":0,"deletions":0},{"path":"app/src-tauri/build.rs","additions":0,"deletions":0},{"path":"app/src-tauri/capabilities/default.json","additions":0,"deletions":0},{"path":"app/src-tauri/icons/128x128.png","additions":0,"deletions":0},{"path":"app/src-tauri/icons/128x128@2x.png","additions":0,"deletions":0},